{"id": "bca226a8-8c18-483c-a0d8-9334a3e8a059", "slug": "platform-infrastructure", "title": "Platform Infrastructure", "description": "Platform Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Platform Infrastructure\"\ndescription: \"Platform Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#EF4444\"\n  accent: \"#EF4444\"\n  background: \"#0F1115\"\n  surface: \"#3F3F46\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#3F3F46\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Platform Infrastructure\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 5; favorites: 7; remixes: 3.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nPlatform Infrastructure Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nAll systems operational Core Architecture High-performance primitives designed for global scale. Our infrastructure abstracts complexity, delivering absolute reliability and zero-trust security natively. Ingestion 1.2M…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Core Architecture; Dynamic Schema Inference; Real-time Threat Isolation; Optimized Path Selection; Eventual Consistency Models.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #EF4444, accent #EF4444, background #0F1115, surface #3F3F46, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Infrastructure</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-400 font-sans antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 md:p-16 overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-zinc-800 selection:text-white relative\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Background Glow -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-3xl h-[400px] opacity-20 pointer-events-none blur-[120px] z-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #3f3f46 0%, transparent 70%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Header Section -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1100px] mx-auto mb-12 relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 w-max\">\n            <span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300\">All systems operational</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-zinc-50 tracking-tight\">Core Architecture</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-base text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">\n            High-performance primitives designed for global scale. Our infrastructure abstracts complexity, delivering absolute reliability and zero-trust security natively.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Grid Container -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1100px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Panel 1: Stream Processing -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden h-[480px] flex flex-col shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n            <!-- Top Glow Line -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-blue-500 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 z-20\"></div>\n            <!-- Background Blur Glow -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none blur-3xl z-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #3b82f6 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 h-2/3 w-full border-b border-zinc-800/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950/50\">\n                <div id=\"scene-1\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 flex items-center gap-3 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 border border-zinc-700/50 text-blue-400 group-hover:bg-blue-500/10 group-hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-colors duration-300 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-zinc-300\">Ingestion</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-6 z-10 transform translate-y-2 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-700/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-blue-300 font-medium font-mono\">1.2M events/s</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"p-8 h-1/3 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10 bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-zinc-100 tracking-tight mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-100 transition-colors\">Dynamic Schema Inference</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                    Ingest unstructured data at scale. The engine parses payloads on the fly, automatically constructing relational models without predefined schemas.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Panel 2: Security & Anomaly -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden h-[480px] flex flex-col shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-red-500 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-15 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none blur-3xl z-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #ef4444 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 h-2/3 w-full border-b border-zinc-800/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950/50\">\n                <div id=\"scene-2\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 flex items-center gap-3 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 border border-zinc-700/50 text-red-400 group-hover:bg-red-500/10 group-hover:border-red-500/30 transition-colors duration-300 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-warning-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-zinc-300\">Security</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"p-8 h-1/3 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10 bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-zinc-100 tracking-tight mb-2 group-hover:text-red-100 transition-colors\">Real-time Threat Isolation</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                    Continuous monitoring of topological behavior. Machine learning models detect irregular access patterns, isolating compromised nodes in milliseconds.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Panel 3: Global Edge -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden h-[480px] flex flex-col shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-purple-500 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none blur-3xl z-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #a855f7 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 h-2/3 w-full border-b border-zinc-800/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950/50\">\n                <div id=\"scene-3\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 flex items-center gap-3 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 border border-zinc-700/50 text-purple-400 group-hover:bg-purple-500/10 group-hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-colors duration-300 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-zinc-300\">Routing</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-6 z-10 transform translate-y-2 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-700/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">Global P99</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-purple-300 font-mono\">< 15ms</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"p-8 h-1/3 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10 bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-zinc-100 tracking-tight mb-2 group-hover:text-purple-100 transition-colors\">Optimized Path Selection</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                    Traffic is dynamically steered across a planetary network. Utilizing BGP Anycast, requests naturally terminate at the nearest healthy PoP.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Panel 4: Distributed State -->\n        <div class=\"group relative rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-700 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden h-[480px] flex flex-col shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-emerald-500 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 z-20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-15 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none blur-3xl z-0\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #10b981 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 h-2/3 w-full border-b border-zinc-800/50 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950/50\">\n                <div id=\"scene-4\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 flex items-center gap-3 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800/50 border border-zinc-700/50 text-emerald-400 group-hover:bg-emerald-500/10 group-hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors duration-300 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-zinc-300\">Consensus</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"p-8 h-1/3 flex flex-col justify-center relative z-10 bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-zinc-100 tracking-tight mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-100 transition-colors\">Eventual Consistency Models</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm\">\n                    Replicate state globally without coordination overhead. CRDTs ensure conflict-free convergence across decentralized data stores.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Three.js Utility setup\n        function createScene(containerId) {\n            const container = document.getElementById(containerId);\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(50, container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n            renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                if (container.clientWidth === 0) return;\n                camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n            });\n\n            return { scene, camera, renderer, container };\n        }\n\n        let time = 0;\n\n        // Scene 1: Flowing Data Streams (Blue)\n        const s1 = createScene('scene-1');\n        s1.camera.position.z = 12;\n        const s1Group = new THREE.Group();\n        s1.scene.add(s1Group);\n\n        const lines = [];\n        const curvePoints = 60;\n\n        for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const positions = new Float32Array(curvePoints * 3);\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n\n            const material = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: new THREE.Color(0x3b82f6).lerp(new THREE.Color(0x60a5fa), Math.random()),\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.15 + (Math.random() * 0.4),\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const line = new THREE.Line(geometry, material);\n            line.userData = {\n                speed: 0.02 + Math.random() * 0.04,\n                offset: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n                ampY: 1.5 + Math.random() * 2,\n                ampZ: 0.8 + Math.random()\n            };\n            s1Group.add(line);\n            lines.push(line);\n        }\n\n        // Scene 2: Threat Detection Network (Red)\n        const s2 = createScene('scene-2');\n        s2.camera.position.z = 8;\n        const s2Group = new THREE.Group();\n        s2.scene.add(s2Group);\n\n        const nodeGeo = new THREE.CircleGeometry(0.06, 16);\n        const nodeMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0x52525b, transparent: true, opacity: 0.8 });\n        const nodes = [];\n\n        for(let i = 0; i < 40; i++) {\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(nodeGeo, nodeMat);\n            mesh.position.set(\n                (Math.random() - 0.5) * 12,\n                (Math.random() - 0.5) * 6,\n                (Math.random() - 0.5) * 4\n            );\n            s2Group.add(mesh);\n            nodes.push(mesh);\n        }\n\n        const lineMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x3f3f46, transparent: true, opacity: 0.3 });\n        const edges = [];\n        nodes.forEach((n1, i) => {\n            nodes.forEach((n2, j) => {\n                if (i < j && n1.position.distanceTo(n2.position) < 2.2) {\n                    const geo = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([n1.position, n2.position]);\n                    const line = new THREE.Line(geo, lineMat);\n                    s2Group.add(line);\n                    edges.push(line);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        const threatGeo = new THREE.CircleGeometry(0.2, 32);\n        const threatMat = new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: 0xef4444, transparent: true, opacity: 0, blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending });\n        const threatNode = new THREE.Mesh(threatGeo, threatMat);\n        s2Group.add(threatNode);\n\n\n        // Scene 3: Global Edge Routing (Purple)\n        const s3 = createScene('scene-3');\n        s3.camera.position.z = 6;\n        const s3Group = new THREE.Group();\n        s3.scene.add(s3Group);\n\n        const sphereGeo = new THREE.SphereGeometry(2.4, 32, 32);\n        const edgesGeo = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(sphereGeo);\n        const sphereMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x5b21b6, transparent: true, opacity: 0.3 });\n        const globe = new THREE.LineSegments(edgesGeo, sphereMat);\n        s3Group.add(globe);\n\n        const routingPoints = [];\n        for(let i=0; i<4; i++) {\n            const p = new THREE.Mesh(\n                new THREE.CircleGeometry(0.1, 16),\n                new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color: 0xc084fc, transparent: true, opacity: 0.9})\n            );\n            s3Group.add(p);\n            routingPoints.push({ mesh: p, angle: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2, speed: 0.015 + Math.random() * 0.02, axis: new THREE.Vector3(Math.random()-0.5, Math.random()-0.5, Math.random()-0.5).normalize() });\n        }\n\n\n        // Scene 4: Distributed State Sync (Emerald)\n        const s4 = createScene('scene-4');\n        s4.camera.position.z = 7;\n        const s4Group = new THREE.Group();\n        s4.scene.add(s4Group);\n\n        const boxSize = 0.9;\n        const centralGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(boxSize, boxSize, boxSize);\n        const centralEdges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(centralGeo);\n        const centralMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x10b981, transparent: true, opacity: 0.6 });\n        const core = new THREE.LineSegments(centralEdges, centralMat);\n        s4Group.add(core);\n\n        const stateNodes = [];\n        for(let i=0; i<5; i++) {\n            const satGeo = new THREE.BoxGeometry(boxSize * 0.4, boxSize * 0.4, boxSize * 0.4);\n            const satEdges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(satGeo);\n            const satMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x059669, transparent: true, opacity: 0.5 });\n            const sat = new THREE.LineSegments(satEdges, satMat);\n\n            const angle = (i / 5) * Math.PI * 2;\n            const r = 2.6;\n            sat.position.set(Math.cos(angle)*r, Math.sin(angle)*r, 0);\n            s4Group.add(sat);\n\n            const lGeo = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints([new THREE.Vector3(0,0,0), sat.position]);\n            const lMat = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({ color: 0x047857, transparent: true, opacity: 0.4, dashSize: 0.15, gapSize: 0.1 });\n            const line = new THREE.Line(lGeo, lMat);\n            line.computeLineDistances();\n            s4Group.add(line);\n\n            stateNodes.push({ mesh: sat, baseAngle: angle, line: line, lGeo: lGeo, speed: 0.01 + Math.random() * 0.01 });\n        }\n\n\n        // Global Animation Loop\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            time += 1;\n\n            // S1: Flowing lines\n            lines.forEach(line => {\n                const positions = line.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                const t = time * line.userData.speed + line.userData.offset;\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < curvePoints; i++) {\n                    const x = (i / curvePoints) * 20 - 10;\n                    const val = x * 0.4 + t;\n                    const y = Math.sin(val) * line.userData.ampY * Math.cos(val * 0.6);\n                    const z = Math.cos(val * 0.9) * line.userData.ampZ;\n\n                    positions[i * 3] = x;\n                    positions[i * 3 + 1] = y;\n                    positions[i * 3 + 2] = z;\n                }\n                line.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n            });\n            s1Group.rotation.y = Math.sin(time * 0.003) * 0.15;\n            s1Group.rotation.x = Math.cos(time * 0.002) * 0.05;\n\n            // S2: Threat Pulse\n            s2Group.rotation.y = time * 0.0015;\n            s2Group.rotation.x = Math.sin(time * 0.001) * 0.15;\n\n            if (time % 150 === 0) {\n                const targetNode = nodes[Math.floor(Math.random() * nodes.length)];\n                threatNode.position.copy(targetNode.position);\n            }\n            const pulse = (Math.sin(time * 0.04) + 1) * 0.5;\n            threatNode.scale.setScalar(1 + pulse * 2);\n            threatNode.material.opacity = (1 - pulse) * 0.9;\n\n            // S3: Globe\n            s3Group.rotation.y = time * 0.002;\n            s3Group.rotation.x = 0.15;\n            routingPoints.forEach(rp => {\n                rp.mesh.position.copy(rp.axis).multiplyScalar(2.45);\n                rp.mesh.position.applyAxisAngle(new THREE.Vector3(0,1,0), time * rp.speed);\n            });\n\n            // S4: Sync Core\n            s4Group.rotation.z = Math.sin(time * 0.004) * 0.1;\n            s4Group.rotation.y = time * 0.005;\n            core.rotation.x = time * 0.01;\n            core.rotation.y = time * 0.015;\n\n            stateNodes.forEach(node => {\n                node.mesh.rotation.x = -time * 0.01;\n                node.mesh.rotation.y = -time * 0.02;\n\n                const floatOffset = Math.sin(time * node.speed + node.baseAngle) * 0.3;\n                node.mesh.position.z = floatOffset;\n\n                node.lGeo.attributes.position.setXYZ(1, node.mesh.position.x, node.mesh.position.y, node.mesh.position.z);\n                node.lGeo.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n            });\n\n            // Render\n            s1.renderer.render(s1.scene, s1.camera);\n            s2.renderer.render(s2.scene, s2.camera);\n            s3.renderer.render(s3.scene, s3.camera);\n            s4.renderer.render(s4.scene, s4.camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-infrastructure.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/platform-infrastructure.jpg", "source_name": "platform-infrastructure-DESIGN.md", "views": 40, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-28T18:18:26.907522+00:00"}